<title>PORTUGAL: Bank/Portugal sets repo, drain rate unchanged.</title>
<headline>Bank/Portugal sets repo, drain rate unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal offered a 10 billion escudo variable rate repurchase pact but left its drain rate, the rate at which it absorbs money market funds, unchanged on Friday for the start of a new commercial bank reserve period.</p>
<p>The bank had been widely expected to cut the drain rate.</p>
<p>Bids for the repo funds must be received by 1515 GMT.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
